OL,3,CFifa opens disciplinary case against
OL,4,CArgentina over World Cup conduct
OL,6,FFifa has launched disciplinary
OL,7,Fproceedings against Argentina over the
OL,8,Fbehaviour of players, including a
OL,9,Fbrawl that broke out right after the
OL,10,FWorld Cup final, and a banner about
OL,11,Fthe Falklands which was displayed
OL,12,Fafter the semi-final against England.
OL,14,FAfter Argentina's World Cup semi-final
OL,15,Fwin over England, a number of players
OL,16,Funveiled a hand-written sign reading
OL,17,F"Las Malvinas son Argentinas" ` "The
OL,18,FMalvinas are Argentine".
