OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785399492
OL,3,CFifa opens disciplinary case against
OL,4,CArgentina over World Cup conduct
OL,6,FArgentina refers to the Falkland
OL,7,FIslands as Islas Malvinas. In 1982,
OL,8,Funder Argentina's then-military
OL,9,Fdictatorship, the islands were
OL,10,Finvaded, triggering a 10-week war won
OL,11,Fby Britain.
OL,13,FUK government officials urged Fifa to
OL,14,Finvestigate, and the football body
OL,15,Fsaid on Wednesday the formal charge
OL,16,Fwas "using a sports event for
OL,17,Fdemonstrations of a non-sporting
OL,18,Fnature".
OL,26,@xD@EOUzD@GO]
