PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785399492
OL,3,CFifa opens disciplinary case against
OL,4,CArgentina over World Cup conduct
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Argentina midfielder
OL,7,FLeandro Paredes faces three charges of
OL,8,Fassault of Spain's Rodri and Eric
OL,9,FGarcia in the post-final clashes,
OL,10,Fwhile defender Nahuel Molina faces two
OL,11,Fcharges and assistant coach Roberto
OL,12,FAyala one.
OL,14,FParedes was shown on camera wrestling
OL,15,FGarcia to the ground after grabbing
OL,16,Fhim by his throat, while Molina
OL,17,Fappeared to punch Rodri as the Spanish
OL,18,Fcite celebrated their victory.
OL,26,@qD@ErtwD@Ert
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
