FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785399492
OL,3,CFifa opens disciplinary case against
OL,4,CArgentina over World Cup conduct
OL,6,FPerhaps more surprisingly, as a ruckus
OL,7,Fbroke out on the pitch, Ayala appeared
OL,8,Fto try to punch Spain's Dani Olmo in
OL,9,Fthe face.
OL,11,FMolina and Thiago Almada also are
OL,12,Fcharged with unsporting behaviour
OL,13,Ffollowing Spain's 1-0 win on July 19
OL,14,Fin New Jersey, with the same charge
OL,15,Flevelled against Spanish midfielder
OL,16,FGavi.
OL,18,FIn the 2024 Euros, one-match bans were
OL,19,Fimposed on Spain's Rodri and Alvaro
OL,20,FMorata after they chanted about
OL,21,FSpain's claims to Gibraltar.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
