CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785399492
OL,3,CFifa opens disciplinary case against
OL,4,CArgentina over World Cup conduct
OL,6,FFifa said all the people charged "have
OL,7,Fnow been provided with the opportunity
OL,8,Fto present their position, following
OL,9,Fwhich a decision will be issued by the
OL,10,FFifa Disciplinary Committee in due
OL,11,Fcourse".
OL,13,FThe alleged offence is one of a raft
OL,14,Fbeing investigated ` relating to a
OL,15,Fnumber of the team's World Cup matches.
