OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785399492
OL,3,CFifa opens disciplinary case against
OL,4,CArgentina over World Cup conduct
OL,6,FAlso under consideration are
OL,7,Fallegations of discriminatory chants
OL,8,Fand gestures, late kick-offs, failure
OL,9,Fto comply with match and security
OL,10,Fprotocols, the display of
OL,11,Finappropriate messages by the team and
OL,12,Fspectators and the throwing of objects
OL,13,Fby spectators.
